_name": "ScreenShot-03.png", "id": "553032207104915", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974740_553032210438248_9007250483209227513_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g47DG0NDSBEQ7kNvwFpK-bW&_nc_oc=Adpg39BNHor-KBrmOtLyOZabe6cnpCmHQFCrPNb40fgNndS4UEYGyBif2SOLufP9eEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rKTTVeh5Bk97EETRa05sFkvg1CJ2rtVsPSf2tCG0jlg&oe=6A0B2C1E"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-05.png", "id": "1063774034975181", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035371_1063774038308514_1405689482698066949_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HXL96Nu3DuYQ7kNvwEVtdEo&_nc_oc=AdpvETrBaWBVq4htPCq5FIWh46kNxuaBiEzqmXKp4EzKkobplD6snLSMSzAkr5BC_9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6aOztiixXVyShOAyxdUUsXg1DAXwZxBIJHG-yfS7yEFA&oe=6A0B0650"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot-01.png", "id": "8514674868623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xqy6PtTwVcQ7kNvwHE8fsE&_nc_oc=AdqZn2OUgorq_wt_Ulz-YzklbM3LV8vajt9E5Y6LoId9tu0mRwL0gfqmrh3p66u2Gqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af67NcG5IjIV7TvdAbWKC_BxVB79fZ5S566y6q8F85LVNQ&oe=6A0B1362"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TMLdQFTkRtYQ7kNvwE97jPl&_nc_oc=AdrFmHf_oR66zP2Hty4a74rknXfQZ0d_RT0CrYTlKwOdqHioUsyX8EKJnvDXtgxC4Y4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41EH2TPjXMK0HMCVI8VuwWWhD2gn0ma7BQZBIxAH8_uQ&oe=6A0B20F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Kue0rZsFJ4Q7kNvwHNjj7A&_nc_oc=AdoX4tHejWtctlcup5UWPlD2iIvDrwAOa8cmug52z2rbl1GPXeg2txlvjJwyTvxkEgI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Qb45H3RC7WSy-OhBY6yAxZ71K_8vTgKb1EJw34DGMMA&oe=6A0B156B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636